-| Pattern | Test type |
-|---------|-----------|
-| `lib/tests/**/*.py` | Python unit tests |
-| `frontend/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}` | Frontend unit tests |
-| `e2e_playwright/**/*_test.py` | E2E tests |
